  "A 55-year-old woman with cirrhosis takes a diuretic, is anxious and has low albumin. " + ABG("7.58", "34", "31") + "; " + NACL(135, 93) + ". " + BASE + MALK + ". Which part of her history best explains the metabolic alkalosis?",
